  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    for pr in range(1, rows+1):\n        for pc in range(1, cols+1):\n            tile = [[None]*pc for _ in range(pr)]\n            valid = True\n            for r in range(rows):\n                for c in range(cols):\n                    if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                        tr, tc = r % pr, c % pc\n                        if tile[tr][tc] is None:\n                            tile[tr][tc] = grid[r][c]\n                        elif tile[tr][tc] != grid[r][c]:\n                            valid = False\n                            break\n                if not valid:\n                    break\n            if valid and all(tile[r][c] is not None for r in range(pr) for c in range(pc)):\n                return [[tile[r%pr][c%pc] for c in range(cols)] for r in range(rows)]\n    return grid\n```",
